DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
11578::$$$message_0092_0000_0000$$$::"Huh...?"[lr]::
11579::$$$message_0092_0000_0001$$$::An odd thing crosses the corner of my eye in the middle of the bridge.[lr]::
11580::$$$message_0092_0000_0002$$$::I pause and observe it, but I can't tell at all what it's trying to do or what it wants.[lr]::
11581::$$$message_0092_0000_0003$$$::"...What is he doing?"[lr]::
11582::$$$message_0092_0000_0004$$$::Fortunately, there aren't any people around.[lr]::
11583::$$$message_0092_0000_0005$$$::I climb up the steel frame and move to the other side to interrogate the suspicious person.::
11584::$$$message_0092_0001_0000$$$::The road on the bridge is empty.[lr]::
11585::$$$message_0092_0001_0001$$$::There's no road closure, yet there's not a single car passing by.[lr]::
11586::$$$message_0092_0001_0002$$$::There stands the most suspicious man.::
11587::$$$message_0092_0002_0000$$$::"...Hey. What are you doing here?"[lr]::
11588::$$$message_0092_0002_0001$$$::"You too. What are you trying to do walking around during the day without a particular objective?"[lr]::
11589::$$$message_0092_0002_0002$$$::...This is the usual, but there's something refreshing about how much we don't get along.::
11590::$$$message_0092_0003_0000$$$::"I'm acting within normal boundaries. The pedestrian bridge is down there. Why are you on the roadside? You're not a bird, so it's not like you to like high places..."[lr]::
11591::$$$message_0092_0003_0001$$$::Oh. Yikes, it seems like he does.::
11592::$$$message_0092_0004_0000$$$::"...Well, it's not like you excessively like high places, right?[lr]::
11593::$$$message_0092_0004_0001$$$::I'm also okay with them to a normal extent, but not enough to go every day."[lr]::
11594::$$$message_0092_0004_0002$$$::...Wait. If it were a decent human being, that height would be scary no matter what.[lr]::
11595::$$$message_0092_0004_0003$$$::I think it's wrong as a living creature to not be cautious about a place like that where you might fall to your death if you take a wrong step.[lr]::
11596::$$$message_0092_0004_0004$$$::Well, I won't say who, but...::
11597::$$$message_0092_0005_0000$$$::"So why are you here?[lr]::
11598::$$$message_0092_0005_0001$$$::It has nothing to do with me, so I want you to explain it exactly to me."[lr]::
11599::$$$message_0092_0005_0002$$$::"I'm only here when I need to be. No matter how much time passes, my fundamental preferences don't change. The cause is my master.[lr]::
11600::$$$message_0092_0005_0003$$$::...Well, let's see. Just think that preferring high places is a strength when it comes to mages."[lr]::
11601::$$$message_0092_0005_0004$$$::"Mrgh."::
11602::$$$message_0092_0006_0000$$$::We both go quiet, with indescribable expressions.[lr]::
11603::$$$message_0092_0006_0001$$$::I understand when he tells me to "just think that."::
11604::$$$message_0092_0007_0000$$$::"All right, I'll pretend like this conversation didn't happen. It would benefit us both for once."[lr]::
11605::$$$message_0092_0007_0001$$$::"That is sensible...but let me warn you. When you cross the ocean, hold back on that and sightseeing. You must avoid bridges more than towers. The bridge that appears in that one song in particular is a matter of life or death."[lr]::
11606::$$$message_0092_0007_0002$$$::"I appreciate the valuable warning. So, can I change that fate?"::
11607::$$$message_0092_0008_0000$$$::"Now. You might be able to postpone it depending on your effort, but...[lr]::
11608::$$$message_0092_0008_0001$$$::It seems like your fate isn't something you can change with just your effort."::
11609::$$$message_0092_0009_0000$$$::Apparently you'll need to get help from others in order to make some definitive changes.[lr]::
11610::$$$message_0092_0009_0001$$$::...The problem is that someone who is associated with Shirou Emiya is the devil that will knock him off of the bridge called the "demon's gate."::
11611::$$$message_0092_0010_0000$$$::"That's not a warning. Don't make it a death sentence."[lr]::
11612::$$$message_0092_0010_0001$$$::"What? You're mentally prepared, right? The winter River Thames is rough. Become an expert in swimming."[lr]::
11613::$$$message_0092_0010_0002$$$::He's laughing joyfully. Dammit, he thinks it's other people's business.::
11614::$$$message_0092_0011_0000$$$::"...Ugh, I don't need to hear about that much into the future. I'm asking about the current bridge.[lr]::
11615::$$$message_0092_0011_0001$$$::You must have something in mind taking position at a high place like this. Are you trying to continue the Holy Grail War?"::
11616::$$$message_0092_0012_0000$$$::...Something that already happened.[lr]::
11617::$$$message_0092_0012_0001$$$::Based on a confrontation that has nothing to do with us, the Shirou Emiya who couldn't pass through the bridge before, is now able to.[lr]::
11618::$$$message_0092_0012_0002$$$::Shirou Emiya won't stand still on the night bridge anymore, but does Archer still plan to repeat this for as long as this Holy Grail War lasts?::
11619::$$$message_0092_0013_0000$$$::"'Continue the Holy Grail War,' huh... I certainly did have a fixation on fighting Saber.[lr]::
11620::$$$message_0092_0013_0001$$$::But, my plan did slightly change. No, rather than a change in mind, I should say that I could see what I need to do now."[lr]::
11621::$$$message_0092_0013_0002$$$::"Huh? Does that mean you're fighting whoever is continuing the Holy Grail War?"::
11622::$$$message_0092_0014_0000$$$::"I thought I had been narrowing down my aim to just that enemy from the start. That was a part of why I was monitoring the town from the rooftop of a building. I wonder how many times I've shot down familiars that have invaded Shinto."[lr]::
11623::$$$message_0092_0014_0001$$$::"Familiars... You mean those dog-like monsters?"::
11624::$$$message_0092_0015_0000$$$::"Yeah. It's a funny story, but I feel like I've been repeating it for many days. Now, I wonder when I realized that it was meaningless. Was it yesterday or just now?"::
11625::$$$message_0092_0016_0000$$$::...Archer himself must not even know the reason he realized that that was "meaningless."[lr]::
11626::$$$message_0092_0016_0001$$$::Just like how the previous me and current me don't connect, Archer's actions don't connect either.::
11627::$$$message_0092_0017_0000$$$::"I see. Either way, you stopped sniping from the rooftop. Did you get tired of shooting down so many of them?"[lr]::
11628::$$$message_0092_0017_0001$$$::"...'Get tired,' huh? I do feel like I have been repeating the same thing. However. Even if it is a day that doesn't change at all from yesterday, I don't get tired of things to the point of them feeling meaningless.[lr]::
11629::$$$message_0092_0017_0002$$$::If I continued shooting based on whether I get tired of it or not, I would've been repeating the same thing for decades."::
11630::$$$message_0092_0018_0000$$$::"...Even if nothing changes and no new things happen?"[lr]::
11631::$$$message_0092_0018_0001$$$::"Of course. Reality is different from a book that you're tired of reading. Even if it's a repetition of the same thing, there's no such thing as nothing happening.[lr]::
11632::$$$message_0092_0018_0002$$$::If...tentatively, there was someone that was tired of that repetition, that person must've repeated the Holy Grail War a million, no, a trillion times."::
11633::$$$message_0092_0019_0000$$$::Repeating a trillion times, huh?[lr]::
11634::$$$message_0092_0019_0001$$$::But, as a result of repeating it a trillion times, Archer might've gotten tired of shooting.[lr]::
11635::$$$message_0092_0019_0002$$$::I'm the same.[lr]::
11636::$$$message_0092_0019_0003$$$::According to Tohsaka, it's restarting and not looping, but I have no way of telling which version of Shirou Emiya I am.::
11637::$$$message_0092_0020_0000$$$::"...Oh well. So, why are you here after quitting shooting? Are you planning to break the bridge this time?"[lr]::
11638::$$$message_0092_0020_0001$$$::"...Well. To be honest, I'm still not really sure."[lr]::
11639::$$$message_0092_0020_0002$$$::...He glares into the horizon.[lr]::
11640::$$$message_0092_0020_0003$$$::His sharp eyes that shoot through an enemy from a thousand miles away...are directed towards the mountains of Ryudou Temple.::
11641::$$$message_0092_0021_0000$$$::"Well, it's what you call excessive solicitude. Even if that was the case, I have no obligation to stay here. I'm just securing an advantageous position just in case."[lr]::
11642::$$$message_0092_0021_0001$$$::"An advantageous position? So you are ready to fight."[lr]::
11643::$$$message_0092_0021_0002$$$::"You're not the one I'm apprehensive about. I'm talking about the familiars that swarm Shinto. It seemed like you had seen them before when we were talking earlier."::
11644::$$$message_0092_0022_0000$$$::More than just seen them before, I've been killed by them countless times.[lr]::
11645::$$$message_0092_0022_0001$$$::...Mysterious monsters. A black stain that covers Fuyuki City completely on the fourth night to put an end to things.[lr]::
11646::$$$message_0092_0022_0002$$$::It seems like Archer also recognizes those monsters as enemies.::
11647::$$$message_0092_0023_0000$$$::"I see. So you were shooting to finish them off."[lr]::
11648::$$$message_0092_0023_0001$$$::"Yeah. But I also quit that. I can't defeat those monsters. No, there's no need to even defeat them. They are harmless. They'll disappear on their own if you leave them alone."[lr]::
11649::$$$message_0092_0023_0002$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
11650::$$$message_0092_0023_0003$$$::[font italic=true]There's no need to even defeat them...?[font italic=false]::
11651::$$$message_0092_0024_0000$$$::"Yeah right. They're rampaging during the night and causing casualties."[lr]::
11652::$$$message_0092_0024_0001$$$::"What are you saying? The others can't stay quiet either if there was such a commotion. I don't know what you're misunderstanding, but there shouldn't be any casualties."::
11653::$$$message_0092_0025_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
11654::$$$message_0092_0025_0001$$$::My eyes go wide this time.[lr]::
11655::$$$message_0092_0025_0002$$$::There are no humans that have been killed by the monsters...?[lr]::
11656::$$$message_0092_0025_0003$$$::No, that is true.[lr]::
11657::$$$message_0092_0025_0004$$$::Just like how that mage woman and Servant don't exist in this city.[lr]::
11658::$$$message_0092_0025_0005$$$::The people who are being killed by monsters here haven't existed from the start.::
11659::$$$message_0092_0026_0000$$$::"...Come to think of it, you're right. But to say they're harmless is too much. They are[line len=2]"[lr]::
11660::$$$message_0092_0026_0001$$$::"They don't kill humans. They just loiter.[lr]::
11661::$$$message_0092_0026_0002$$$::They do seem to have some objective though. It seems to me like those monsters have appeared in this city to do something."[lr]::
11662::$$$message_0092_0026_0003$$$::That's the conclusion from a Servant who has shot down those monsters thousands of times.::
11663::$$$message_0092_0027_0000$$$::"...Now. I was interrupted, but I got the overall point. If I were to take position, then it'd be on top of that arch after all..."[lr]::
11664::$$$message_0092_0027_0001$$$::Archer finishes his inspection and leaves the elevated road.::
11665::$$$message_0092_0028_0000$$$::"Don't dawdle too much. You're the subject of this Holy Grail War. There's no way for the play to end if the main character doesn't get up on stage."[lr]::
11666::$$$message_0092_0028_0001$$$::Archer must've turned into spirit form, as he disappeared without going down to the pedestrian bridge.::
11667::$$$message_0092_0029_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
11668::$$$message_0092_0029_0001$$$::Lanes without any cars.[lr]::
11669::$$$message_0092_0029_0002$$$::   The monsters have an objective...[lr]::
11670::$$$message_0092_0029_0003$$$::Those words don't leave my mind.::
911587::$$$message_9092_0002_0000$$$::"...Hey. What are you doing here?"[r]2oâr